---
title: Terms of use — Frost Alerts
description: Frost Alerts terms of use and privacy. Learn how we process data to send free frost alerts near you and for your area.
homeLabel: Home page
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block main %}
	<main>
		<section class="container py-5">
			<div class="row py-lg-5">
				<article class="col-lg-7 p-4 p-md-5">
					<h1 class="fw-light mb-3">Service terms of use</h1>
					<p class="lead text-muted col-lg-10">You remain the owner of the personal data you entrust to us.
						You can request their modification or deletion at any time. We strive to protect them as best
						as possible.
					</p>
				</article>
				<article class="col-lg-7 p-4 p-md-5">
					<h2 class="fw-light mb-3">Personal data</h2>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10"><small>Last updated: November 25, 2026</small></p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">The information collected on the registration form is recorded in
						a computerized file by <a href="./contact.html">FrostAlert.net</a> to analyze weather
						forecasts and send alerts. The legal basis for processing is user consent.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">We collect: your email address, your city, zip code and country,
						your language and temperature unit preferences, the optional comment you leave on the form,
						and the record of your consent. Your city and zip code are converted into approximate
						coordinates (the center of the town or zip code area, never your street address).</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">The collected data may indirectly be communicated to the
						following service providers, only to run the service:</p>
					<ul class="text-muted col-lg-10">
						<li><a href="https://www.scaleway.com/en/privacy-policy/"
								rel="noopener noreferrer">Scaleway</a> (email service provider): your email address
							and the content of the alerts;</li>
						<li><a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement"
								rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Azure</a> (hosting, data storage, technical logs,
							and Azure Maps to turn your city and zip code into approximate coordinates);</li>
						<li><a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open-Meteo</a>
							(weather forecasts): only the approximate coordinates of your town, never your email
							address.</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">Data is kept for the duration of the user's subscription to the
						service and up to 7 days after the user has notified their unsubscription, for technical
						reasons (data cleanup). Technical logs do not contain your email address and are kept for up
						to 30 days.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">Feedback may be kept without personal data. When an e-mail address
						is provided with consent to receive a reply, it is automatically deleted after 30 days.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">This website uses no cookies, no analytics and no advertising
						trackers.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">You can access the data concerning you, rectify it, request its
						deletion or exercise your right to limit the processing of your data. You can withdraw your
						consent to the processing of your data at any time. You can also object to the processing of
						your data. You can also exercise your right to data portability.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">Visit the <a href="https://gdpr.eu" target="_blank"
							rel="noopener"><acronym title="General Data Protection Regulation">GDPR</acronym>
							website</a> for more information about your rights. </p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">To exercise these rights or for any question about the processing
						of your data in this system, you can <a href="./contact.html">contact us</a>.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">If you believe, after contacting us, that your
						<q>Information and Freedoms</q> rights are not respected, you can file a complaint with your
						local <a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en/data-protection-around-the-world" target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">data protection authority</a>.
					</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">If we change this notice, we will update the date at the top of
						this section. If a change affects how we use your data, we will tell subscribers by email
						before it takes effect.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="col-lg-7 p-4 p-md-5">
					<h2 class="fw-light mb-3">For users in the United States</h2>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">We do not sell or share your personal information, and we do not
						use it for targeted advertising or profiling. We do not collect precise geolocation.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">Because this website does not track you, there is nothing to turn
						off: Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control signals are respected by default.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">This service is not directed to children under 13 and we do not
						knowingly collect their personal information. If you believe a child has signed up, please
						<a href="./contact.html">contact us</a> and we will delete the data.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">Wherever you live, including California, you can ask us what
						data we hold about you, have it corrected, or have it deleted, by
						<a href="./contact.html">contacting us</a> or using the unsubscribe link in any alert. We
						will not treat you differently for exercising these rights.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">If you believe your privacy rights are not respected, you can
						contact the <a href="https://oag.ca.gov/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California
							Attorney General</a>, the <a href="https://cppa.ca.gov" target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">California Privacy Protection Agency</a>, the
						<a href="https://reportfraud.ftc.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Federal Trade
							Commission</a>, or your
						<a href="https://www.naag.org/find-my-ag/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">state Attorney
							General</a>.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="col-lg-7 p-4 p-md-5">
					<h2 class="fw-light mb-3">For users in Australia</h2>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">You can ask to access or correct the personal information we hold
						about you, or have it deleted, by <a href="./contact.html">contacting us</a>.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">Your information is stored and processed outside Australia, by the
						service providers listed above (Scaleway, Microsoft Azure and Open-Meteo).</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">Alerts are only sent to people who signed up, always identify us
						as the sender, and include an unsubscribe link.</p>
					<p class="text-muted col-lg-10">If you are not satisfied with our response to a privacy
						complaint, you can contact the
						<a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au/privacy/privacy-complaints" target="_blank"
							rel="noopener">Office of the Australian Information Commissioner</a>.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="col-lg-7 p-4 p-md-5">
					<h2 class="fw-light mb-3">How it works</h2>
					<p class="lead text-muted col-lg-10">This free service is maintained by volunteers.</p>
					<p class="lead text-muted col-lg-10">Once registered, we analyze weather forecasts and send an
						alert when temperatures close to zero or negative are forecast in your city.
					</p>
					<p class="lead text-muted col-lg-10">You can stop at any time.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
			<div class="row flex-lg-row-reverse align-items-center py-lg-5">
				<article class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-lg-6 p-4 p-md-5">
					<img src="./asset/undraw_terms_re_6ak4.svg" class="d-block mx-lg-auto img-fluid"
						alt="A person signing the service terms of use" width="300" height="276" />
				</article>
				<article class="col-lg-6 p-4 p-md-5">
					<h2 class="fw-light">Sign up</h2>
					<p class="lead text-muted">Do these conditions suit you?</p>
					<p><a href="./sign-up.html" class="btn btn-primary my-2">Yes, continue</a></p>
					<p><a href="./index.html" class="d-inline-block my-4">Back to home</a></p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="py-5 bg-light">
			<div class="container">
				<p>For any additional question (or just to chat) you can <a class="text-dark"
						href="./contact.html">contact us</a>.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
{%- endblock %}
